OL,3,AThe 'trillion pound' oil fund the
OL,4,Agovernment believes Britain could have
OL,5,Abuilt
OL,6,
OL,7,FAfter a half-century wait, the United
OL,8,FKingdom now has an oil fund.
OL,10,FChancellor John Healey announced the
OL,11,Fcreation of an Energy Wealth Fund at
OL,12,Fthe Jackdaw gas approval announcement
OL,13,Fon Wednesday, with #2bn of funding
OL,14,Fdiverted from the existing National
OL,15,FWealth Fund.
OL,17,FA selection of energy exporting
OL,18,Fcountries, mainly in the Gulf, but also
OL,19,Fincluding Norway, over the years have
OL,20,Famassed multi-trillion funds using oil
OL,21,Fand gas revenues to create epic
OL,22,Fnational piggy banks.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
