OL,3,AThe 'trillion pound' oil fund the
OL,4,Agovernment believes Britain could have
OL,5,Abuilt
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt has been a long-standing debate in
OL,8,FUK economic policy circles. If
OL,9,Fneighbouring Norway has amassed a
OL,10,F$2.4tn war chest from the same North
OL,11,FSea, where exactly did the UK's
OL,12,Fsovereign wealth fund go?
